     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Selection and presentation",
     "texto": [
      "**Vinkling** is the angle from which a news story is presented. The **kildegrunnlag** indicates which sources it relies on.",
      "A **motstemme** gives a different perspective. Its presence alone does not guarantee that the information is balanced."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Editorial responsibility",
     "texto": [
      "**Redaksjonelt ansvar** covers decisions about what is published, how it is contextualised and which data are checked."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
